#!srs 1
@program {"name": "Motion Demo", "description": "Linear, joint, arc and blended moves"}
var r = 5

SetTool Gripper
SetBlendRadius 5
MoveJ Home
MoveL Approach, blend=on
MoveL Pick1, offset=(z=20), blend=$r
MoveC Place1, via=Via1, speed=80, tolerance=0.1
JumpL Pick1, z=60, zEnd=80
SetLocal Fixture1
MoveL here, offset=(x=10, y=10)
ClearLocal
MoveJ Home
